  <p id="c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:intro" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:intro:m0000" ref="p86_bh6_jm2">華軼</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:intro:m0004" ref="p86_bh6_jm2">彥夏</persName>，平原人，魏太尉<persName id="c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:intro:m0014" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2">歆</persName>之曾孫也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:father" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">太中大夫。父<persName id="c-jinshu-061-jin044-huabiao:father:m0006" ref="7zi_5gs_mq2_AD">澹</persName>，河南尹。</p>
